  "Point of No Return#032": {
   "src": "Explore this happier version of {p}.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "objective",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#033": {
   "src": "Ahh... a newcomer? Welcome, welcome.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#034": {
   "src": "Do not worry, you are safe here. The Obelisk protects us all.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#035": {
   "src": "An beacon of safety amidst the terror outside... what a miracle, to have found it awaiting us in our time of need.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#036": {
   "src": "Rest well, friend. You have made it home. Feel free to familiarize yourself with it.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#037": {
   "src": "How long has it been since a new face has joined us? I can't quite seem to recall...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#038": {
   "src": "Don't be fooled - everything you see around you is very real.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#039": {
   "src": "Where did your soul go?!",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "captured"
  },
  "Point of No Return#040": {
   "src": "Is this... {p}? It seems different.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "captured"
  },
  "Point of No Return#041": {
   "src": "You look different in the mirror. It is a reflection of your inner self.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "captured"
  },
  "Point of No Return#042": {
   "src": "You've left the darkness...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "captured"
  },
  "Point of No Return#043": {
   "src": "Something must be left behind. And you must leave.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "captured"
  },
  "Point of No Return#044": {
   "src": "...more than anything beyond, at least. The Obelisk protects us, after all.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#045": {
   "src": "Do you feel its pull? It calls to us all, when we arrive.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#046": {
   "src": "Why would anyone choose to resist? The world is twisted, wrong... we do not belong there.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#047": {
   "src": "It is by the Bovine's grace that the Obelisk has seen fit to bless us with this sanctuary.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#048": {
   "src": "There is no fault in giving in. It only wants to protect us. Is that so wrong?",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#049": {
   "src": "Why would you ever want to leave?",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "Lutho Guard",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#050": {
   "src": "...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "???",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#051": {
   "src": "{u}.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 10",
   "speaker": "???",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#052": {
   "src": "Leave Happier {p}.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "objective",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 11",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#053": {
   "src": "If you truly want to leave... no one here will stop you. But are you really willing to go through with it?",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 11",
   "speaker": "Lutho Guard",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#054": {
   "src": "Talk to the {p} Citizen who sent you on this journey.",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "objective",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#055": {
   "src": "Ha... I saw it there. That flicker in your eyes...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#056": {
   "src": "You have been... shattered. Just like me, ha, ha, ha...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#057": {
   "src": "The others... all have given into its pull. Our band of survivors... left behind, abandoned...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#058": {
   "src": "I cannot blame them. Such a loss must seem a blessing, compared to life out here...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#059": {
   "src": "How long has it been, since we found ourselves trapped here...? Longer than anyone has any right to live... ha, ha...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#060": {
   "src": "Perhaps I am already gone. More dead than alive. Hollowed out...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#061": {
   "src": "All it does is take. More, and more, and more, until nothing is left... ha, ha, ha...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
  },
  "Point of No Return#062": {
   "src": "It takes... and takes... until...",
   "dst": "",
   "role": "desc",
   "kind": "dialogue",
   "quest": "Point of No Return",
   "stage": "Stage 12",
   "speaker": "Lutho Citizen",
   "source": "wiki"
